      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like im constantly taking and taking and never giving anything back. my sister spends all her time helping me with everything and i can see how tired she is. it’s like i’m just a weight around her neck. i hate that i can't just be a normal person who actually contributes instead of just being another thing for everyone to manage.",
