    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried talking to her but it just made it worse. she was so kind about it but i could tell she was just being nice and she doesn't want to hurt my feelings. it just feels like a lie. every time she helps me i feel like i'm stealing her life away. i'm just a drain on her. there's no real way for me to fix it, i'm just broken.",
